---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Kontakt - Art Portfolio" description="Kontaktieren Sie mich">
  <article class="contact-content">
    <div class="contact-header">
      <h1>Kontakt aufnehmen</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">
        Interessiert an meiner Arbeit? Ich freue mich von Ihnen zu hören.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="contact-body">
      <div class="contact-info">
        <div class="info-block">
          <h3>E-Mail</h3>
          <a href="mailto:ihre@email.de">ihre@email.de</a>
        </div>

        <div class="info-block">
          <h3>Atelier</h3>
          <p>
            [Ihre Atelieradresse]<br>
            [Stadt, Bundesland/Land]
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="info-block">
          <h3>Folgen</h3>
          <div class="social-links">
            <a href="https://instagram.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Instagram</a>
            <a href="https://twitter.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Twitter</a>
            <a href="https://linkedin.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="info-block">
          <h3>Verfügbarkeit</h3>
          <p>
            Derzeit nehme ich Aufträge und Kooperationsanfragen entgegen.
            Bitte erlauben Sie 2-3 Werktage für eine Antwort.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <form class="contact-form" name="contact" method="POST" data-netlify="true">
        <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="contact">
        
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="name">Name</label>
          <input type="text" id="name" name="name" required>
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="email">E-Mail</label>
          <input type="email" id="email" name="email" required>
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="subject">Betreff</label>
          <input type="text" id="subject" name="subject" required>
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="message">Nachricht</label>
          <textarea id="message" name="message" rows="6" required></textarea>
        </div>

        <button type="submit" class="submit-btn">Nachricht senden</button>
      </form>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>

<style>
  .contact-content {
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .contact-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
    min-height: 140px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .subtitle {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    opacity: 0.7;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .contact-body {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.5fr;
    gap: 4rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .contact-info {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2.5rem;
  }

  .info-block h3 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    opacity: 0.6;
  }

  .info-block p {
    line-height: 1.6;
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  .info-block a {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-color: var(--color-border);
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .social-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .contact-form {
    background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.02);
    padding: 2.5rem;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }

  .form-group {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  label {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  input,
  textarea {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 0.75rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    background-color: var(--color-bg);
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 1rem;
    transition: border-color 0.3s ease;
  }

  input:focus,
  textarea:focus {
    outline: none;
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  textarea {
    resize: vertical;
  }

  .submit-btn {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 1rem;
    background-color: var(--color-accent);
    color: var(--color-bg);
    border: none;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
  }

  .submit-btn:hover {
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    .contact-form {
      background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .contact-body {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 3rem;
    }

    .contact-form {
      padding: 2rem;
    }
  }
</style>